        "Description": "Ameer - Collect coins from the bar, wait for speech to start. Blend into the crowd and toss a coin to the left of the stage. Knock Ameer out and toss him over.\r\rMobeen - Go back to bar, wait for waiter patrol, knock out and hide waiter patrol, explode propane tank and go back the way you came.\r\rAazaad - Clear out the security room nearby and the guard by the elevator. Leave a one hand gun at the corner of the elevator shaft. Headshot or overhead pacify (fish) and he will fall into the shaft.",
